[54.288, "o", "Longhorn is missing. Install it now? [optional] [y] (y/n): Rancher is missing. Install it now? [optional] [y] (y/n): The in-cluster registry is missing. Install it now? [optional] [y] (y/n): cert-manager is missing. Install it now? [required for TLS-dependent installs] [y] (y/n): Base domain (used to build hostnames) [example.local]:\r\n"]
[54.387, "o", "TLS options:\r\n"]
[54.486, "o", "  1) Let's Encrypt (requires public DNS + inbound 80/443)\r\n"]
[54.585, "o", "  2) Self-signed (works anywhere; you'll need to trust certs in browser/docker)\r\n"]
[54.683, "o", "Choose TLS mode (1/2) [2]: Longhorn data mount path [/data]: Longhorn default replica count (1 for single-node) [1]:\r\n"]
