[69.0, "o", "LAST DEPLOYED: Tue Sep  1 15:39:10 2026\r\n"]
[69.099, "o", "NAMESPACE: cattle-system\r\n"]
[69.197, "o", "STATUS: deployed\r\n"]
[69.296, "o", "REVISION: 1\r\n"]
[69.395, "o", "TEST SUITE: None\r\n"]
[69.494, "o", "NOTES:\r\n"]
[69.593, "o", "Rancher Server has been installed. Rancher may take several minutes to fully initialize.\r\n"]
[69.692, "o", "Please standby while Certificates are being issued, Containers are started and the Ingress rule comes up.\r\n"]
[69.791, "o", "Check out our docs at https://rancher.com/docs/\r\n"]
[69.889, "o", "## First Time Login\r\n"]
[69.988, "o", "If you provided your own bootstrap password during installation, browse to https://rancher.k3s.lab.internal to get started.\r\n"]
[70.087, "o", "If this is the first time you installed Rancher, get started by running this command and clicking the URL it generates:\r\n"]
[70.186, "o", "```\r\n"]
[70.285, "o", "echo https://rancher.k3s.lab.internal/dashboard/?setup=$(kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}')\r\n"]
[70.384, "o", "```\r\n"]
[70.482, "o", "To get just the bootstrap password on its own, run:\r\n"]
[70.581, "o", "```\r\n"]
[70.68, "o", "kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}{{ \"\\n\" }}'\r\n"]
[70.779, "o", "```\r\n"]
[70.878, "o", "Happy Containering!\r\n"]
